--- A mask of another length than the frame's rows stops, in the words a
--- list's mask does, in both modes: one made of another frame's column
--- (a mask that compares the frame's own columns is as long as it is).
use frame
f = frame.new[n = [1, 2, 3]]
g = frame.new[n = [1, 2]]
log[len[f[f.n gt 1]]]
log[f[g.n gt 1]]
log['not reached']
